            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "make_it_spicy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I tried this recipe with pine nuts and then again with walnuts. Both were great. The only tip I have is to combine the dry ingredients before adding the wet ones. Works great in a food processor!",
            "datePublished": "2016-11-06T22:56:41.253Z"
          },
