              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lucy Logan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We’ve beeen making this recipe for about 24 years. Sometimes we add 1/4 t pepper; and we leave out the cheese when we freeze little jars of pesto . It’s so much better than store-bought. It’s great!",
            "datePublished": "2024-09-12T22:21:40.642Z"
          },
          {
