            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SusietheCat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have never reviewed anything on allrecipes.com, but I just made this pesto and it was MARVELOUS! Other than leaving out the teaspoon of salt, I made it according to the recipe. It was absolutely the best pesto I have ever had--maybe it's the nutmeg? Anyway, if you have some fresh basil, make this! You will LOVE it!",
